## 3. Deploy-path harness at 79b17ebc: every odds step of HEAD's deploy.yml, per case
##    Note: the COVERAGE line's 'the other 5 are covered by ... not by this harness' is
##    imprecise. check-odds-calls-guarded's log-only self-test makes all 9 sites log-only,
